<http://data.silknow.org/object/74dd5139-2e74-3ce4-ab14-7fd2a9e157b5/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Dress fabric of silk damask and metal thread.\n\nWoven silk and metal thread damask, twill binding.\nWarp: dark blue silk, Z-twist.\nWeft: silk: dark blue, green, light red, all indeterminable twist and white silk, S-twist.\nMetal thread: silver-gilt strip open s-wound on yellow silk and open S-wound on white silk, both indeterminable twist.\nDark blue ground with small dark blue pattern of flowers and stems. The main pattern is one complete and two partial large 7-petalled flowers with small boteh shaped leaves all outlined in light red and worked in either 'gold' or 'silver'."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/74dd5139-2e74-3ce4-ab14-7fd2a9e157b5> .

